      "bottomRightX": 667,
      "bottomRightY": 228,
      "content": "The eye diagrams are to be centered using the jitter transfer function (JTF). The recovered clock is obtained from the data and processed by the JTF. The center of the recovered clock is used to position the center of the data in the eye diagram.",
